2. Energy-drift tolerance applied to coarsest grid; 3. determinism compared `wall_seconds`; 4. zero-mean momentum normalization; 5. wrong order-2 energy-defect expectation; 6. collocated-control residual is O(1), not O(h²); 7. near-zero energy normalization; 8. **missing N1 lock guard** in the canonical artifact → revision requested and delivered (`lock_guard()`, `--lock-guard`, gate `G11`).

